00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.620
if you severely traumatize them.

265
00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:54.240
So this idea that these molecules are giving you hope

266
00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:55.580
even in very difficult times.

267
00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.800
So it's not innately human, there's existence of it--

268
00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.497
That's right, it's not innately humans.

269
00:12:59.497 --> 00:13:01.137
It is in other mammals.

