278
00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.310
'cause they look a lot like us

279
00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:23.240
in some of the very basic social and psychological ways.

280
00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.820
So extrapolating on that idea,

281
00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.037
what do you make of that?

