00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.360
and the science is pointing to

300
00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:20.110
is that movement is how your brain knows you are alive

301
00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.720
and engaged in life.

302
00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:24.500
And when you move on a regular basis,

303
00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:27.520
your brain basically says,

304
00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:30.230
I guess we have to be the best version of ourselves

