00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.930
and antidepressant effect.

315
00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.060
This is a crazy stuff.

316
00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.490
It's not just an endorphin rush,

317
00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.840
it's like at every level of our biology.

318
00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:06.020
When we move, our brain is like,

