00:47:50.410 --> 00:47:51.590
for safety before we put them

1051
00:47:51.590 --> 00:47:52.604
into the products that we use.

1052
00:47:52.604 --> 00:47:53.660
Also shocking.

1053
00:47:53.660 --> 00:47:56.650
