00:49:30.220 --> 00:49:32.200
that are manufacturing products,

1098
00:49:32.200 --> 00:49:33.580
a lot of large conglomerates

1099
00:49:33.580 --> 00:49:34.770
started making these products

1100
00:49:34.770 --> 00:49:37.300
