1102
00:49:39.190 --> 00:49:42.220
And now I think that the challenge becomes

1103
00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:43.213
how do you undo this?

1104
00:49:43.213 --> 00:49:45.370
And how do you, when you're sitting

1105
00:49:45.370 --> 00:49:46.781
