do the right thing and you take a massive hit.

1108
00:49:53.310 --> 00:49:54.541
I think people are scared to change.

1109
00:49:54.541 --> 00:49:57.611
And I think that we haven't updated major federal laws

1110
00:49:57.611 --> 00:50:00.370
since 1938, I mean, it's been over 80 years.

1111
00:50:00.370 --> 00:50:01.308
So--

