1115
00:50:07.740 --> 00:50:09.450
One and a half pages of legislation

1116
00:50:09.450 --> 00:50:11.870
that govern an $80 billion industry

1117
00:50:11.870 --> 00:50:13.920
that still allow for chemicals of concern

1118
00:50:13.920 --> 00:50:15.320
that are known to be cause,

1119
00:50:15.320 --> 00:50:17.420
that cause cancer, linked to endocrine-disrupting,

