All of that is coming to a crisis point.

1295
00:58:29.638 --> 00:58:30.614
It's not working.

1296
00:58:30.614 --> 00:58:31.447
And that happens every day in an ICU

1297
00:58:31.447 --> 00:58:34.178
where all the technology at hand finally fails

1298
00:58:34.178 --> 00:58:36.523
and there's nothing more we can offer.

1299
00:58:37.377 --> 00:58:38.400
And the patients die.

1300
00:58:38.400 --> 00:58:42.150
And then there's a second half to the journey

1301
00:58:42.150 --> 00:58:45.950
that is the definition of that being a physician state,

1302
00:58:45.950 --> 00:58:48.981
or being a caretaker, being a nurse is when you set down

1303
00:58:48.981 --> 00:58:52.450
the machinery and you sit down with the patient and say,

1304
00:58:52.450 --> 00:58:54.750
we've done our best, we have done everything

1305
00:58:54.750 --> 00:58:56.290
we know how to do.

1306
00:58:56.290 --> 00:58:58.770
And we acknowledge that you are alive

1307
00:58:58.770 --> 00:59:02.396
and we acknowledge that you are here with us in this moment.

1308
00:59:02.396 --> 00:59:05.140
And we acknowledge that you're gonna likely expand

1309
00:59:05.140 --> 00:59:07.278
to the other side of this rebirth that we call death.

1310
00:59:07.278 --> 00:59:10.474
And in that time with your patients right now,

1311
00:59:10.474 --> 00:59:13.902
I want you to know that we see the greatest victory

1312
00:59:13.902 --> 00:59:17.540
right there, 'cause ultimately as physicians

1313
00:59:17.540 --> 00:59:20.717
and practitioners, we don't actually save lives.

1314
00:59:20.717 --> 00:59:24.380
We don't have that level of capacity or responsibility.

1315
00:59:24.380 --> 00:59:27.470
Life is something much greater than human.

1316
00:59:27.470 --> 00:59:31.040
Life is a gift and it's not your responsibility

1317
00:59:31.040 --> 00:59:32.160
to maintain it.

1318
00:59:32.160 --> 00:59:33.830
It's your responsibility to show up

1319
00:59:33.830 --> 00:59:37.478
and bring the highest level of compassion skill

1320
00:59:37.478 --> 00:59:41.220
capacity that you can, but you will do your highest work

1321
00:59:41.220 --> 00:59:44.680
when you recognize that this miraculous life that we live,

1322
00:59:44.680 --> 00:59:47.660
this miraculous gift of life is transient.

1323
00:59:47.660 --> 00:59:51.150
It is temporal, and it is our calling to be present

1324
00:59:51.150 --> 00:59:52.510
with that and acknowledge it

1325
00:59:52.510 --> 00:59:55.610
and see the beauty in every phase of it.

1326
00:59:55.610 --> 00:59:57.870
And when you've got a young person who's dying

1327
00:59:57.870 --> 00:59:59.967
or an elderly person who's dying,

1328
00:59:59.967 --> 01:00:03.890
it's easy to get caught up in the emotions of the loss,

1329
01:00:03.890 --> 01:00:07.570
but we need to get better and celebrate the moment

1330
01:00:07.570 --> 01:00:09.513
of acknowledging the gain.

1331
01:00:09.513 --> 01:00:11.200
This is a life well lived.

1332
01:00:11.200 --> 01:00:15.312
This is a person who has created in their lifetime,

1333
01:00:15.312 --> 01:00:16.480
this is the person who's loved in their lifetime,

1334
01:00:16.480 --> 01:00:18.853
this is a person who's really in it

1335
01:00:18.853 --> 01:00:23.300
for the big big story of what it means to be human.

1336
01:00:23.300 --> 01:00:26.000
And this was a soul that came in on purpose

1337
01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:28.120
and has lived some version of that purpose.

1338
01:00:28.120 --> 01:00:29.867
And we acknowledge that.

1339
01:00:29.867 --> 01:00:32.280
And so I hope that in the same way

1340
01:00:32.280 --> 01:00:36.213
that the messy garden can start to look like a victory,

1341
01:00:36.213 --> 01:00:39.810
the mess of healthcare can be very victorious

1342
01:00:39.810 --> 01:00:41.620
if we recognize each other's humanity.

1343
01:00:41.620 --> 01:00:44.910
And if we really embrace the beauty of human life

1344
01:00:44.910 --> 01:00:48.220
and consciousness, that becomes often most poignant

1345
01:00:48.220 --> 01:00:50.550
and most obvious when we're about to lose it.

1346
01:00:50.550 --> 01:00:52.880
And we let go of that human consciousness

1347
01:00:52.880 --> 01:00:54.960
to plug into something much, much bigger.

1348
01:00:54.960 --> 01:00:58.920
And I hope that you get to see

1349
01:00:58.920 --> 01:01:01.817
as the veil thins with your patients right now,

1350
01:01:01.817 --> 01:01:03.820
you get to get to see that other side

1351
01:01:03.820 --> 01:01:05.240
and realize that they have no fear

1352
01:01:05.240 --> 01:01:06.950
on the other side of that veil.

1353
01:01:06.950 --> 01:01:10.472
And so their coming back and forth out of cautiousness

1354
01:01:10.472 --> 01:01:11.600
and back into consciousness in those last few minutes

1355
01:01:11.600 --> 01:01:14.410
and hours and days, I hope that you get a glimpse

1356
01:01:14.410 --> 01:01:16.630
of the beauty on the other side,

1357
01:01:16.630 --> 01:01:18.940
and a state of being that's free of fear,

1358
01:01:18.940 --> 01:01:22.940
free of sense of loss and only sees the opportunity

1359
01:01:22.940 --> 01:01:25.230
and expansion and light.

1360
01:01:25.230 --> 01:01:30.230
And so take this opportunity to let down the expectations

1361
01:01:31.260 --> 01:01:34.014
on yourself and give up on a sense of failure.

1362
01:01:34.014 --> 01:01:35.770
Let go of your sense of failure

1363
01:01:35.770 --> 01:01:38.380
in those moments when the ventilators failing,

1364
01:01:38.380 --> 01:01:41.000
actions failing, the numbers are going south.

1365
01:01:41.000 --> 01:01:44.031
Don't let that define your success.

1366
01:01:44.031 --> 01:01:46.195
Be present with your patients right now.

1367
01:01:46.195 --> 01:01:48.970
Let, let them not die in vain,

1368
01:01:48.970 --> 01:01:50.592
let them be part of the message

1369
01:01:50.592 --> 01:01:54.150
that this virus is trying to teach us.

1370
01:01:54.150 --> 01:01:56.251
Let their journey be part of you.

1371
01:01:56.251 --> 01:01:59.100
Reach out to them and hold their hands right now

1372
01:01:59.100 --> 01:02:03.900
and give them a sense of deep purpose

1373
01:02:03.900 --> 01:02:07.410
in this extreme thing that they've been called to.

1374
01:02:07.410 --> 01:02:09.270
If they're called to pass right now,

1375
01:02:09.270 --> 01:02:10.640
let them know it's not in vain,

1376
01:02:10.640 --> 01:02:11.870
that we're gonna learn from this,

1377
01:02:11.870 --> 01:02:15.850
that we are realizing that we have taken too many steps

1378
01:02:15.850 --> 01:02:18.420
away from our purpose, our real nature,

1379
01:02:18.420 --> 01:02:21.100
our real potential and that they are doing

1380
01:02:21.100 --> 01:02:23.840
their highest work right now in walking the journey

1381
01:02:23.840 --> 01:02:27.740
of dying in this situation to teach us a deep lesson

1382
01:02:27.740 --> 01:02:29.190
of what it means to be connected

1383
01:02:29.190 --> 01:02:32.460
and disconnected and a pathway towards reconnection.

1384
01:02:32.460 --> 01:02:35.340
And let them know that their highest victory is at hand

1385
01:02:35.340 --> 01:02:39.700
and that they are part of the rise of human consciousness

1386
01:02:39.700 --> 01:02:41.863
and not the collapse of biology on planet.

1387
01:02:44.560 --> 01:02:47.050
That's what I want you to grab right now

1388
01:02:47.050 --> 01:02:52.050
and just know that I had just deep gratitude

1389
01:02:52.570 --> 01:02:54.973
for your courage to keep showing up.

1390
01:02:58.490 --> 01:03:00.534
Love you, brother.

1391
01:03:00.534 --> 01:03:01.367
Thank you.

